[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2732395181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104303#issuecomment-2732395181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104303","id":2732395181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i3Qqt","user":{"login":"bac0id","id":41997195,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTk3MTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41997195?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id","html_url":"https://github.com/bac0id","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bac0id/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T09:51:19Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T09:57:51Z","body":"I think we should also consider what would happen if we changed\n```\n@export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type2\") var enum_type = \"Type1\"\n```\nwhen `Type2` is selected in the inspector, to\n```\n@export_enum(\"Type2\", \"Type1\") var enum_type = \"Type1\"\n```\nor\n```\n@export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type3\", \"Type2\") var enum_type = \"Type1\"\n```\nI don't have time to test this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2732395181/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2732407346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104303#issuecomment-2732407346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104303","id":2732407346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i3Toy","user":{"login":"SilverWolveGames","id":92260598,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX_I9g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92260598?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames","html_url":"https://github.com/SilverWolveGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T09:53:19Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T09:53:19Z","body":"I've just tested it and ... same result !","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2732407346/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2732566264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104303#issuecomment-2732566264","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104303","id":2732566264,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i36b4","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T10:23:52Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T10:25:15Z","body":"```gdscript\n@export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type2\") var enum_type = \"Type1\"\n```\nmakes the `enum_type` be a `String`, as the type is inferred from the default value (`= \"Type1\"`).\n\nHence when \"Type2\" is selected in the inspector what's stored in the `.tscn` file is `enum_type = \"Type2\"` (you can open the scene file with any text editor), and such stored String value is preserved when changing to e.g.:\n```gdscript\n@export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type4\") var enum_type = \"Type1\"\n```\nAFAICT this is correct behavior. Changing the list of available options doesn't by itself affect/change the currently stored value.\n\n---\n\nIf you'd make the value be stored as `int`, then initially selecting \"Type2\" would make it be saved as `enum_type = 1`, and thus it would refer to the second parameter of `@export_enum` even after changing it (assuming not using custom values like `\"Type2:345\"`), which is the behavior you're expecting. But note that setting the default value like `= \"Type1\"` of course won't work for int.\n```gdscript\n# Type is String, the default value is \"Type1\".\n@export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type2\") var enum_type = \"Type1\"\n\n# Type is String, the default value is \"\" (String's default).\n@export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type2\") var enum_type: String\n\n# Type is int, the default value is 0.\n@export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type2\") var enum_type = 0\n\n# Type is int, the default value is 0 (int's default).\n@export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type2\") var enum_type: int\n```\n\nNot sure if there's anything to be improved [in the docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_%40gdscript.html#class-gdscript-annotation-export-enum)?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2732566264/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2732605017","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104303#issuecomment-2732605017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104303","id":2732605017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i4D5Z","user":{"login":"SilverWolveGames","id":92260598,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX_I9g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92260598?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames","html_url":"https://github.com/SilverWolveGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverWolveGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T10:36:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T10:38:36Z","body":"OK, it works well when I replace ```= \"Type1\"``` by an int. It also works if I write this : ``` @export_enum(\"Type1\", \"Type1\") var enum ```, without initailizing the value.\nThank you !","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2732605017/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]